# Mash Frontend Environment Configuration

# Backend API base URL (FastAPI connector)
# In production, set to your publicly accessible backend domain (e.g., https://api.mash.example.com)
# In local development, defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Cloud Gateway Authentication & Account Services (optional)
# Defaults to https://api.mash.ai
NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL=https://api.mash.ai
